WEBVTT

00:01.710 --> 00:03.753
Mornin'!

00:06.005 --> 00:07.924
Y'know, what surprises me

00:08.508 --> 00:11.469
even more than the fact that a legendary
hitman turned back into a kid

00:11.553 --> 00:14.431
is that you got hooked on studying!

00:15.432 --> 00:17.308
Wait, totally got it!

00:17.392 --> 00:20.520
It's so when you turn back,
you can broaden the kind of work you do!

00:20.603 --> 00:21.521
As if.

00:21.604 --> 00:24.149
I'm only doing it because it's fun.

00:25.066 --> 00:26.609
Studying is fun?

00:27.318 --> 00:29.154
Literally no clue
what you're talkin' about.

00:29.237 --> 00:30.447
Why not?

00:31.239 --> 00:34.743
Well, I guess that's just how it is
when you're young.

00:36.161 --> 00:37.829
Oga, mornin'.

00:39.247 --> 00:41.708
Wait, are you talking to me?

00:41.791 --> 00:42.709
Yep.

00:42.792 --> 00:43.626
Mornin'.

00:45.420 --> 00:46.963
Good morning.

00:47.046 --> 00:48.381
Takada.

00:48.465 --> 00:49.382
Baba.

00:49.466 --> 00:50.383
Whoa!

00:50.467 --> 00:52.844
Your smile is kinda creepy, Oga.

00:54.387 --> 00:57.390
You can jump
into the group chat more, you know.

00:57.474 --> 00:58.600
Yeah.

00:58.683 --> 01:00.101
The group?

01:00.185 --> 01:01.728
Oh, SNS.

01:02.729 --> 01:03.980
I'll do my best.

01:05.148 --> 01:07.859
I really am bad with kids.

01:10.236 --> 01:14.157
A veteran hitman who could silence
even a crying child and now I'm "Oga."

02:54.966 --> 02:58.887
SATURDAY, APRIL 18TH

02:59.554 --> 03:00.763
So, that's Lenon?

03:00.847 --> 03:02.098
It's Noren!

03:03.474 --> 03:04.517
Take your marks!

03:05.643 --> 03:06.769
Ready...

03:14.068 --> 03:15.069
Amazing!

03:15.153 --> 03:17.196
- So fast!
- She's like a racehorse!

03:17.280 --> 03:18.239
- Totally!
- Crazy fast!

03:18.323 --> 03:20.700
You really can't judge a book
by its cover.

03:46.517 --> 03:48.686
Her name is Noren Mitsuoka.

03:49.604 --> 03:51.564
If you can make contact with her,

03:51.648 --> 03:54.025
you might be able to gain
some useful information.

03:54.108 --> 03:54.943
Huh?

03:55.026 --> 03:56.569
Hold on a second!

03:56.653 --> 03:59.447
She's just the daughter of the president
of Mitsuoka Pharmaceuticals, right?

04:00.031 --> 04:02.325
It's not like we're gonna get
useful information just from--

04:02.408 --> 04:04.285
I know that.

04:05.286 --> 04:08.873
But right now, I'll take anything
I can get, even the tiniest lead.

04:08.957 --> 04:10.458
BACKGROUND CHECK REPORT

04:14.420 --> 04:16.297
Anyway...

04:16.381 --> 04:18.716
you're still rocking that loner life, huh?

04:19.300 --> 04:21.010
Pipe down. Leave me alone.

04:21.594 --> 04:24.639
There's more than a 20-year
generation gap between us.

04:24.722 --> 04:28.268
If I fit right in,
that would be the shocking part.

04:28.893 --> 04:31.145
Still, I do like schoolwork.

04:31.771 --> 04:35.024
But this isn't really a place
for an old guy like me.

04:35.108 --> 04:39.529
The best thing would be to turn back
to normal and get out of here.

04:40.196 --> 04:41.739
Yeah, guess so.

04:41.823 --> 04:44.742
Which means Eri was right after all.

04:44.826 --> 04:47.287
MOMOFUKU ANDO
INVENTOR OF INSTANT RAMEN NOODLES

04:47.870 --> 04:49.080
Well, whatever.

04:49.163 --> 04:50.999
I'm not expecting much

04:51.582 --> 04:53.626
but I'll try talking to her anyway.

04:55.753 --> 04:58.089
Um, Mitsuoka...

04:58.881 --> 05:00.508
Do you have a minute?

05:01.801 --> 05:03.886
Huh? What? Creepy.

05:03.970 --> 05:06.681
Unless this is some kind of announcement,
could you disappear?

05:07.932 --> 05:09.809
Oh, right.

05:09.892 --> 05:10.893
Never mind.

05:11.394 --> 05:12.687
See you.

05:18.651 --> 05:20.862
WE'VE GOT SCIENCE LAB NEXT!

05:28.745 --> 05:29.537
FIRST-YEAR SCIENCE

05:34.500 --> 05:36.210
Boss! Pull yourself together!

05:36.878 --> 05:40.465
The number one saddest thing for
an older guy to hear from a young girl...

05:40.548 --> 05:41.466
"creepy"!

05:41.549 --> 05:43.092
And she said it with total disgust!

05:43.176 --> 05:46.220
Undiluted, pure
one hundred percent disgust!

05:49.140 --> 05:50.183
Boss!

05:51.476 --> 05:53.436
Boss!

05:53.519 --> 05:55.438
And then, like, last night, I was--

05:55.521 --> 05:56.355
Ow!

05:56.439 --> 05:57.273
Whoa, Oga?

05:57.356 --> 05:58.900
- What're you doing? Creepy!
- Again?

06:00.610 --> 06:02.403
Oh, Noren?

06:02.987 --> 06:05.364
She seriously hates guys.

06:05.448 --> 06:07.575
Wait, you didn't know that till now?

06:08.910 --> 06:11.454
Well, she's good
at both studying and sports,

06:11.537 --> 06:12.580
and her parents are rich.

06:13.539 --> 06:16.584
And she's this super tall,
gorgeous girl, like a model.

06:16.667 --> 06:19.337
You'd never believe
she was recently in elementary school.

06:20.004 --> 06:23.299
So, yeah, all kinds of guys ask her out,

06:23.382 --> 06:26.344
and she shoots them down brutally
with zero consideration.

06:27.428 --> 06:32.100
So, well, even among the girls,
she kind of stands out a little.

06:32.183 --> 06:34.102
Like, she's hard to approach.

06:35.895 --> 06:38.856
So, what now, Boss?

06:39.440 --> 06:41.442
That's a dead end.

06:41.526 --> 06:43.653
No way in there.

06:44.278 --> 06:46.197
If you're a guy, you're out.

06:46.280 --> 06:48.658
And if you're an old man on the inside,
that's even worse.

06:49.408 --> 06:52.411
Well, it was a long shot from the start.

06:52.495 --> 06:53.412
Let's just give up.

06:53.496 --> 06:54.956
NATSUKIYA RAMEN

06:55.039 --> 06:56.374
Guess so.

06:56.457 --> 06:59.168
NATSUKIYA RAMEN

06:59.252 --> 07:00.169
RAMEN

07:00.253 --> 07:03.047
Come to think of it,
this is my first time around here.

07:05.007 --> 07:07.176
Boss, no garlic!

07:07.260 --> 07:08.261
Welcome!

07:08.928 --> 07:10.430
Counter seat up front, please!

07:23.943 --> 07:25.736
Thanks for waiting!

07:28.072 --> 07:29.240
Here's your water.

07:29.740 --> 07:30.575
Thanks.

07:31.367 --> 07:32.702
What'll you have?

07:32.785 --> 07:34.078
Uh...

07:34.162 --> 07:36.330
Ramen with a seasoned egg.

07:36.414 --> 07:37.707
One ramen with egg!

07:37.790 --> 07:39.208
Comin' right up!

07:43.754 --> 07:45.047
No way!

07:45.131 --> 07:46.924
What the hell is going on here?

07:47.008 --> 07:48.259
Noren Mitsuoka?

07:48.342 --> 07:51.095
Why is a pharmaceutical president's
daughter working at a ramen shop?

07:51.179 --> 07:53.806
Middle schoolers aren't even allowed
to have part-time jobs, are they?

07:53.890 --> 07:56.058
Though I was a hitman in middle school...

07:56.142 --> 07:58.186
No, wait, maybe she just looks
exactly like her!

07:58.269 --> 07:59.979
Here you go! Thanks for waiting!

08:00.771 --> 08:04.025
I have no idea what's going on,
but first things first.

08:13.659 --> 08:15.036
So good!

08:15.119 --> 08:18.498
At first glance, it looks like
a standard old-school shoyu ramen

08:18.581 --> 08:22.502
but the noodles, the toppings...
the quality is on a whole different level!

08:23.211 --> 08:24.629
More than anything, this broth!

08:29.258 --> 08:30.718
This is it!

08:30.801 --> 08:34.180
It's light, but the richness and depth
of flavor are incredible!

08:34.263 --> 08:36.015
And it pairs perfectly with the noodles!

08:37.225 --> 08:38.267
This is...

08:38.976 --> 08:40.061
sublime!

08:40.144 --> 08:41.354
Excuse me, sir.

08:43.147 --> 08:47.026
When the shop closes,
could you meet me around back?

08:51.948 --> 08:53.574
You're Ogami, right?

08:53.658 --> 08:55.785
Why are you here, of all places?

08:55.868 --> 08:58.663
Well, because this is near my house.

08:59.914 --> 09:02.917
It's far from the station and there's
nowhere around here to hang out,

09:03.000 --> 09:05.962
so I was sure this was the last place
anyone from school would show up!

09:06.045 --> 09:08.756
- Dammit!
- Thought you were safe, huh?

09:08.839 --> 09:10.091
Please!

09:10.174 --> 09:13.094
Just please keep this a secret at school!

09:14.095 --> 09:16.639
Y-Yeah, sure. I can do that.

09:18.224 --> 09:20.017
Do you always go home alone?

09:20.101 --> 09:21.811
I do. Why?

09:22.395 --> 09:25.147
Well, couldn't someone pick you up?

09:25.231 --> 09:27.567
You're pretty rich, aren't you?

09:29.527 --> 09:31.153
I hate that kind of thing.

09:31.862 --> 09:33.072
Yeah?

09:33.698 --> 09:35.324
Natsukiya, was it?

09:35.866 --> 09:38.077
That shop belongs to my uncle.

09:38.703 --> 09:40.329
I'm not getting paid or anything.

09:40.413 --> 09:42.456
It's more like I'm helping out a relative.

09:42.540 --> 09:45.668
So, if it's not a part-time job,
then why do it?

09:47.378 --> 09:48.796
Good question.

09:50.590 --> 09:52.592
Yeah, I guess you could say I'm rich.

09:52.675 --> 09:54.093
Very rich, in fact.

09:55.052 --> 09:59.724
I've got a Canadian mom,
and I'm fully aware of how I look.

10:00.516 --> 10:03.352
I know I've been blessed, believe me.

10:03.436 --> 10:05.813
I'm even introduced to guys

10:05.896 --> 10:08.691
they think would make
good future husbands for me.

10:08.774 --> 10:10.776
And I'm still just a middle schooler.

10:11.944 --> 10:16.198
They'd only just met me,
they didn't know anything about me at all,

10:16.282 --> 10:18.284
and yet they'd be all nice.

10:18.868 --> 10:22.371
Even when I was still in
elementary school, I looked grown-up,

10:22.455 --> 10:24.749
so they treated me like an adult woman.

10:26.375 --> 10:29.712
And all I could think was,
"This is seriously disgusting."

10:31.339 --> 10:33.132
And once I got to middle school,

10:33.215 --> 10:36.927
finally the boys in my class started
looking at me the same way.

10:37.011 --> 10:39.805
All thanks to these
oh-so-blessed specs of mine.

10:40.389 --> 10:41.432
Oh yeah?

10:41.974 --> 10:45.311
So, that's where that hardcore
hatred of men comes from.

10:45.394 --> 10:48.606
That's why I want to own a ramen shop!

10:49.315 --> 10:50.566
Really?

10:51.484 --> 10:52.652
Wait, why?

10:53.444 --> 10:54.904
I told you already.

10:54.987 --> 10:57.865
I really hate my family's
old-fashioned mindset,

10:57.948 --> 11:00.660
the whole "women should get married
and become housewives" thing!

11:01.494 --> 11:04.121
I want to live on my own strength.

11:04.205 --> 11:07.416
I want to carry on the flavor
of my beloved uncle's ramen.

11:09.460 --> 11:10.836
My uncle became a ramen chef

11:10.920 --> 11:14.757
because he hated the thought
of only hanging around other rich people.

11:22.139 --> 11:24.225
Whenever I was hurting,

11:24.308 --> 11:26.852
he'd just make ramen for me
without saying a word.

11:36.278 --> 11:40.699
The ramen my uncle
made for me was truly delicious!

11:44.036 --> 11:47.456
You remind me of my uncle, Ogami.

11:47.540 --> 11:48.624
I wonder why.

11:49.250 --> 11:50.918
Thanks to that, I ended up talking a lot.

11:52.461 --> 11:54.088
I'm an old guy, too.

11:56.424 --> 11:59.552
Well, shouldn't you just do
what you want to do?

12:01.429 --> 12:02.805
Just because you're a kid

12:02.888 --> 12:06.350
doesn't mean you're obligated to live
the way your parents want you to.

12:07.268 --> 12:09.728
Anyway, that ramen really was good!

12:10.729 --> 12:11.981
Especially the broth!

12:15.234 --> 12:16.444
Really?

12:16.527 --> 12:17.528
Right?

12:17.611 --> 12:19.530
That broth is incredible!

12:19.613 --> 12:22.032
And today's batch made me extra happy,

12:22.116 --> 12:25.202
because they let me
help out a little with the prep!

12:25.286 --> 12:27.037
The base is chicken stock,

12:27.121 --> 12:29.457
but they blend in
a special seafood broth, too!

12:29.540 --> 12:32.001
And they're super particular
about the aromatic vegetables...

12:32.877 --> 12:34.879
Well, this is where I turn, so...

12:34.962 --> 12:36.297
Oh, right.

12:36.380 --> 12:37.715
This doesn't mean

12:37.798 --> 12:40.676
you can suddenly start acting all friendly
with me at school tomorrow.

12:40.759 --> 12:42.052
Right.

12:42.136 --> 12:44.221
Back to her man-hater mode.

12:57.109 --> 12:58.611
Huh? Wha--

13:06.702 --> 13:08.412
What the hell?

13:08.496 --> 13:11.123
They just snatched her out of nowhere!
What kind of crap is that?

13:12.166 --> 13:14.627
Well, with a parent involved
in some shady stuff, too.

13:14.710 --> 13:16.378
When you're the head
of a major corporation

13:17.129 --> 13:20.257
there are any number of reasons
someone might target you.

13:20.341 --> 13:21.175
Boss!

13:21.258 --> 13:22.760
I'm looking into it now!

13:23.802 --> 13:24.637
HACHIOJI

13:24.720 --> 13:27.264
It's a black minivan. Hachioji plates.

13:27.848 --> 13:31.852
There's no registration seal so there's
a good chance the plates are fake.

13:31.936 --> 13:33.103
What do you want to do?

13:34.188 --> 13:35.523
Me...

13:35.606 --> 13:38.150
I happen to think
the most delicious food in the world is

13:38.234 --> 13:40.110
ramen.

13:41.195 --> 13:42.196
Huh?

13:44.365 --> 13:47.535
The bag had one of those
transmitter rounds in it, right?

13:47.618 --> 13:49.703
And the app to receive the signal, too?

13:49.787 --> 13:51.539
Yeah, that's right.

13:51.622 --> 13:54.208
Wait, you're going after them?
That's impossible now!

13:54.792 --> 13:56.460
They're going way too fast!

13:57.670 --> 14:00.631
And that round's from a handgun, right?

14:03.092 --> 14:05.219
There's no way you're gonna hit it!

14:08.931 --> 14:10.641
I know all that.

14:10.724 --> 14:13.269
How many years do you think
I've been doing this?

14:24.280 --> 14:26.198
Aiming doesn't mean anything
at this point!

14:26.282 --> 14:27.408
How are you even--

14:27.491 --> 14:28.242
Shh!

14:32.329 --> 14:36.750
Well, call it a veteran's experience
and instinct.

14:44.425 --> 14:45.217
Got it.

14:46.594 --> 14:47.928
I don't believe it!

14:48.012 --> 14:49.179
Huh?

14:50.890 --> 14:53.183
- Must've been my imagination.
- Get out and check.

14:53.851 --> 14:56.145
Quit barking orders and just drive!

14:58.814 --> 14:59.690
I've...

15:00.316 --> 15:02.693
still only had one bowl.

15:08.073 --> 15:11.285
I'm going after the heir to that ramen!

15:11.368 --> 15:13.996
Like hell I'm letting that be taken away!

15:21.462 --> 15:23.047
You're almost there!

15:23.130 --> 15:24.131
Yeah!

15:34.642 --> 15:36.185
Relax, you'll be fine.

15:36.268 --> 15:39.688
If you just stay quiet,
we won't do anything that hurts.

15:39.772 --> 15:40.731
Probably.

15:40.814 --> 15:42.900
Man, she's cute up close!

15:42.983 --> 15:44.693
Is she really even a middle schooler?

15:44.777 --> 15:47.613
This is so easy.

15:47.696 --> 15:50.324
Maybe I'll grab a little smooch.

15:50.407 --> 15:52.409
D-Don't touch me, you creep!

15:55.454 --> 15:56.872
Do your job properly.

15:57.456 --> 16:00.960
Well, sorry about that idiot.

16:01.669 --> 16:04.380
Don't worry. I'll kill him later.

16:04.964 --> 16:08.008
In exchange, could you tell me one thing?

16:08.842 --> 16:12.721
That top secret new drug
your father's company is developing.

16:13.389 --> 16:15.724
You possess its secret, don't you?

16:15.808 --> 16:16.934
Huh?

16:17.559 --> 16:20.020
What's that supposed to mean?
What are you talking about?

16:20.104 --> 16:21.230
No, no.

16:21.814 --> 16:23.941
That's what the client told us.

16:24.024 --> 16:29.154
"We don't know what it is exactly,
but there's no doubt that she has it."

16:29.738 --> 16:31.907
I don't know! Really!

16:31.991 --> 16:35.786
I've never heard anything
about my dad's work!

16:35.869 --> 16:37.997
Oh, really?

16:38.080 --> 16:39.623
I'm telling you, I don't know!

16:39.707 --> 16:41.500
I have no idea what you're talking about!

16:42.626 --> 16:45.004
That ramen shop where you work...

16:45.587 --> 16:48.048
That's your beloved uncle's place, right?

16:48.841 --> 16:51.677
Actually, I went there to eat yesterday.

16:53.095 --> 16:58.142
The floor and the counter were filthy
and anyway, it tasted awful.

16:58.225 --> 17:01.270
Can't even call crap like that "food."

17:01.854 --> 17:04.898
A place like that oughta be wiped out

17:05.733 --> 17:07.026
smashed to pieces!

17:11.739 --> 17:14.616
Stop it!
My uncle has nothing to do with this!

17:14.700 --> 17:16.326
Yeah, so...

17:16.827 --> 17:21.749
if you tell me the secret, I think this
irritation of mine might just calm down.

17:22.332 --> 17:23.709
I don't know!

17:23.792 --> 17:26.253
What the hell is he going on about?

17:27.504 --> 17:28.338
Huh?

17:33.552 --> 17:36.722
How could you say that ramen tastes bad?

17:37.222 --> 17:39.058
Maybe you have no taste at all.

17:39.683 --> 17:40.559
Huh?

17:41.351 --> 17:43.020
- Oops, sorry about that.
- Wait!

17:43.103 --> 17:44.730
Can't let your identity
get exposed, right?

17:44.813 --> 17:45.647
Who are you?

17:45.731 --> 17:47.232
- Mr. Tajima!
- What is this?

17:47.316 --> 17:49.359
Who the hell are you, you little brat?

17:49.443 --> 17:51.236
I'm older than you, moron.

17:51.820 --> 17:56.033
Before I beat your ass, a senior in life's
got two pieces of advice for you.

17:56.116 --> 17:59.745
First, don't call food
someone made for you "awful."

17:59.828 --> 18:00.996
Second--

18:01.080 --> 18:03.540
Shut up! You can figure out in hell
that this ain't make-believe!

18:03.624 --> 18:05.876
Hey. Don't make me give you more advice.

18:08.128 --> 18:10.672
When someone's talking,
listen all the way to the end.

18:10.756 --> 18:11.590
What was that?

18:12.174 --> 18:14.885
Oh, nonlethal rubber rounds?

18:14.968 --> 18:17.763
I'm not killing anybody off the clock.

18:18.347 --> 18:20.057
- What was that sound?
- It came from over there!

18:20.140 --> 18:21.725
Sounds like there's
quite a few of 'em left!

18:21.809 --> 18:24.770
And getting out of there
with the girl is gonna be impossible!

18:24.853 --> 18:26.105
Uh, what's happening?

18:26.188 --> 18:27.689
Get this off of me!

18:30.567 --> 18:32.319
We're going to take a little ride.

18:32.986 --> 18:35.072
Here, hold on tight to this.

18:49.253 --> 18:50.754
You're heavier than I expected.

18:50.838 --> 18:52.422
- Who the hell is that?
- Freeze!

18:54.258 --> 18:55.342
Pardon me!

18:55.926 --> 18:56.760
What's happening?

19:00.889 --> 19:02.266
Straight ahead to the stairs!

19:03.058 --> 19:04.518
I-I'm getting sick!

19:40.179 --> 19:41.597
Whew!

19:41.680 --> 19:43.515
Somehow you made it out!

19:46.810 --> 19:48.645
Screw the job!

19:48.729 --> 19:51.023
I'm gonna crush you like a frog!

19:53.483 --> 19:54.818
Bulletproof, huh?

19:54.902 --> 19:56.612
Even a 9mm might not do the trick.

19:57.196 --> 19:58.780
If it were just the boss,
that's one thing,

19:58.864 --> 20:00.115
but with that girl, too...

20:00.949 --> 20:02.701
Excuse me a second!

20:05.412 --> 20:07.748
Good thing I picked this up on the way.

20:12.252 --> 20:15.839
Oh, to continue from what I was saying
back in the classroom...

20:16.548 --> 20:18.425
my second piece of advice.

20:19.343 --> 20:21.345
It may be an old-fashioned way
of thinking...

20:24.431 --> 20:25.432
but regardless,

20:26.058 --> 20:29.561
any man who can't treat
a woman kindly is trash.

20:32.981 --> 20:34.608
Whew, I'm beat.

20:34.691 --> 20:36.902
Looks like that wraps it up, Boss!

20:36.985 --> 20:37.819
Now then...

20:38.445 --> 20:39.279
Huh?

20:40.530 --> 20:42.824
Mind taking one whiff of this?

20:42.908 --> 20:45.285
What is...

20:47.663 --> 20:48.538
All right.

20:48.622 --> 20:49.706
Oh!

20:52.084 --> 20:53.168
What is it?

20:53.252 --> 20:54.378
SOCIAL STUDIES

20:54.461 --> 20:56.838
I left my study guide behind.

22:33.185 --> 22:34.352
Huh?

22:34.436 --> 22:35.479
What?

22:36.897 --> 22:38.523
Was it all a dream?

22:39.024 --> 22:39.941
Ow!

22:42.652 --> 22:44.488
So, it wasn't a dream.

22:44.571 --> 22:46.323
Then who...

22:48.408 --> 22:49.659
That voice!

22:49.743 --> 22:50.744
Don't tell me...

22:52.579 --> 22:53.789
Ogami!

22:55.749 --> 22:56.917
Morning.

22:58.001 --> 23:02.380
Last night, were you the one who saved me?

23:03.048 --> 23:04.257
Saved you?

23:04.341 --> 23:05.759
Did something happen?

23:05.842 --> 23:08.595
Oh, you mean about working
at the ramen shop?

23:08.678 --> 23:11.139
No, that's not-- Don't mention that!

23:11.223 --> 23:12.682
I won't...

23:13.767 --> 23:17.771
but if possible, there is one thing
I'd like to ask in return.

23:17.854 --> 23:19.106
W-What is it?

23:19.689 --> 23:23.193
I want to start dropping by
for that ramen once in a while...

23:24.194 --> 23:26.988
but could you treat me to my next bowl?

23:31.118 --> 23:32.244
That's two things.

23:33.203 --> 23:34.496
But fine.

23:35.080 --> 23:36.373
Can I add an egg?

23:36.456 --> 23:38.166
No toppings!

23:38.250 --> 23:39.376
Aw, come on!
